text:
... interestingly, Anthropic&#x27;s SRT is built on the same macOS primitives and DOES support the network configuration I&#x27;m looking for:<p><a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;anthropics&#x2F;sandbox-runtime&#x2F;tree&#x2F;main#as-a-library" rel="nofollow">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;anthropics&#x2F;sandbox-runtime&#x2F;tree&#x2F;main#as-a...</a><p><pre><code>  const config: SandboxRuntimeConfig = {
    network: {
      allowedDomains: [&#x27;example.com&#x27;, &#x27;api.github.com&#x27;],
      deniedDomains: [],
    },
    filesystem: {
      denyRead: [&#x27;~&#x2F;.ssh&#x27;],
      allowWrite: [&#x27;.&#x27;, &#x27;&#x2F;tmp&#x27;],
      denyWrite: [&#x27;.env&#x27;],
    },
  }</code></pre>
